										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Special performance</h2>
<p>1.High specific strength, high specific modulus. Specific strength is more than 10 times the same section of wire, than the modulus after the special grade carbon fiber.<br />
2.The fiber density is low, the density is 0.97-0.98g / cm3, can float on the surface.<br />
3.Low elongation at break, breaking power, has a strong ability to absorb energy, which has a prominent impact resistance and cutting resistance.<br />
4.Anti-ultraviolet radiation, anti-neutron and γ-ray, high specific energy absorption, low dielectric constant, high transmittance of electromagnetic waves.<br />
5.Resistance to chemical corrosion, wear resistance, a longer flex life.</p>
<h2>Physical properties</h2>
<p>Density: 0.97 to 0.98 g / cm3<br />
Intensity: 2.8 to 4 N / tex<br />
Modulus: 91 to 140 N / tex<br />
Elongation: 3.5% ~ 3.7%<br />
Impact absorption energy than para-aramide fiber nearly doubled, good wear resistance, friction coefficient is small, but the stress is only 145 ~ 160 ℃</p>
<h2>Application</h2>
<p>Bullet-proof protective equipment, rope, cable, fishing nets, sports equipment</p>
